{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read. A record dropped for room is reported as it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped; while that report waits unread, later ones merge into it, one report counting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them all across their timestamps. So the reports waiting unread hold at most one overflow","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report between any two others (denials and finished trackers), however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overflow. The sequence ends once the consent is gone and every report has been read.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA0B10DropReportOGvp","title":"dropReports","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Consent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L117"},"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"AsyncQueue","abstract":[{"text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/dropReports":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports","title":"dropReports"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"Trackers","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/ConsentDropReport":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consentdropreport","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" dropped before they were delivered, and why."}],"title":"ConsentDropReport"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"title":"Consent"}}}